### 小红书审核系统 API测试
### 使用IntelliJ IDEA的HTTP Client进行测试

### 1. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. 单条内容审核
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/test123",
  "forceRefresh": false
}

### 3. 批量审核
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "links": [
    "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/1",
    "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/2",
    "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/3"
  ]
}

### 4. 上传Excel文件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-posts.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./test-posts.xlsx
--WebAppBoundary--

### 5. 查询任务状态
# 替换 {jobId} 为实际的任务ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/job/{{jobId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. 查询审核结果
# 替换 {postId} 为实际的帖子ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/result/{{postId}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. 下载审核结果
# 替换 {jobId} 为实际的任务ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit/download/{{jobId}}?format=xlsx
Accept: application/octet-stream

### 8. 获取API文档 (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### 9. 获取Actuator信息
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### 10. 获取应用指标
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json

###
